From 342daaef48b8f93a065186b61e063b23b8c1f8b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:36:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] MiniMax-M3.1: chat-template goldens, tokenizer cases, MiniMax
 tool-call parser

Adds test-minimax-template (host only). The checkpoint's chat_template.jinja
renders byte for byte as Python Jinja2 does on a 55-case corpus through
core/template with no engine change; tokenizer.json loads through
core/tokenizer and matches the Python tokenizers library on 28 strings
(test skips without -Dmm3-tokenizer=PATH). server/tool_minimax.zig parses
the `]<]minimax[>[<tool_call>` format (nested mapping/list parameters,
schema-typed scalars, UNVERIFIED), with streaming, text filter, hiding and
<mm:think> marker support in tool_parse, tool_stream and reply_text.

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QguKy82jHfqdgzDsrrC5xs
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
